# FINN runs fully without any key (rules, heuristics and build-time extractions).
# Add a Gemini key to switch on live AI: filing summaries, guidance extraction for any ticker,
# people extraction from filings, and the written bull/bear synthesis.
#   Local:  copy this file to .env.local and fill it in, then `npm run dev`
#   Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add GEMINI_API_KEY → redeploy
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional model overrides (defaults shown)
# GEMINI_MODEL_FAST=gemini-2.5-flash-lite   # bulk extraction (guidance claims, people)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash             # filing one-liners
# GEMINI_MODEL_DEEP=gemini-2.5-flash        # synthesis, with thinking

# Optional shared cache across serverless instances (Upstash Redis REST). Without it, an in-memory cache is used.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
